{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L110","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":110,"end":110}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":110,"end":110},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:f9d4471ccd72865c9c2571cfc5d74862f0cb3d633df20bc1fa98104741c6466e","meta":{"text":"Back-compat shim: `isIndexed(repoRoot)` for callers that only know the work-tree root."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L115","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":115,"end":123}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":115,"end":123},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:f0ad4fb7cbe37d89e431ddf67af8c8b61c8b9a366fde6f7b784ca197f455260e","meta":{"text":"Build the IndexStore from the soul, persisting it to the manifest's declared index path.\nThe manifest path (`.crib/index/crib.sqlite`) is **repo-root-relative** by convention. When\n`cribDir === <repoRoot>/.crib` (the standard layout) it resolves against `repoRoot` as before.\nWhen the registry has redirected `cribDir` to a custom location, the index lives *inside* that\n`cribDir` (it's a derived artifact of the soul, so it travels with it) — the leading `.crib/` is\nstripped so the path lands at `<cribDir>/index/crib.sqlite`. Absolute manifest paths are honored."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L137","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":137,"end":141}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":137,"end":141},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:69a57b21194da633bbeb74142580e8249d5ef546bc0479398912008581627fbe","meta":{"text":"Open the derived IndexStore WITHOUT rebuilding from the soul (M6 incremental path). Used by\n`crib update`, which mutates the soul then applies an `IndexDelta` to the existing index. Throws if\nno index exists yet (run `crib index` first)."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L152","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":152,"end":152}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":152,"end":152},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:9dfbdff5c0966f7f314a4de053e154c0a7a14ead0bbf4ba25075921e8c4aed0d","meta":{"text":"Resolve a manifest index path (repo-root-relative by convention) to an absolute on-disk path."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L47","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":47,"end":51}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":47,"end":51},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:4a3210097a6f958273b94a0cbe8e2ed53c80d6b8fb079d22cf7a677b83f04272","meta":{"text":"Resolve the project root + soul directory per the priority chain above. Never throws — a miss\nreturns `{ repoRoot: <candidate>, cribDir: <candidate>/.crib }` so the caller's `isIndexedRoot`\ncheck produces the familiar \"not indexed\" error rather than a crash."}}
